# Force LF line endings on checkout, regardless of platform or a
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. .editorconfig only guides editors
# that honor it; this is enforced by Git itself at checkout/commit time.
#
# It matters here specifically because every composite action embeds bash
# directly in action.yml `run:` blocks. A CRLF pulled in via a Windows
# checkout doesn't just show up as a diff noise - it breaks the script at
# runtime (e.g. `set -euo pipefail\r` => "set: invalid option").
* text=auto eol=lf
